      <p class="founder__role">Founder — Destin L. Mincy Software and AI Agency</p>

      <p>
        I'm a software engineer based in Maryville, Tennessee — Blount County born and
        raised. I've spent twenty years shipping production code across full-stack web,
        backends, data pipelines, and custom tools. The last few years have been heavy
        on AI integrations and agent systems — which is where the agency lives now.
      </p>

      <p>
        The pattern I kept seeing at every small business I worked with was the same:
        a stack of tasks that didn't need a human, but no one had the time to automate
        them. SaaS tools almost fit. Custom builds were overkill. AI agents — narrow,
        well-trained, supervised — sit exactly in that gap. So I built one. Then I
        founded an agency to build more.
      </p>

      <p>
        The agency started in January 2026. <a href="/work/elatum/">ELATUM</a> — AI
        guest support for short-term rental operators in the Smokies — is the first
        product. Local-first by design, because that's the work I know how to do.
        The next agents will be too.
      </p>
    </div>
